From 3de38a1e3167a410cd1f53af3ece8518c888864a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Nov 2023 10:25:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rss/kronos: Split fwu_agent.c and refactor metadata code

Split:
->The provisioning metadata code will be as a part of BL1_2
  binary stored in OTP, but the OTP size is 16MB which is
  limited, so split the fwu_agent_rss.c from fwu_agent.c to
  control the size of BL1_2 and it will only be used by BL1.
->AP metadata will be added, the size of BL1_2 will be more
  if not split.

Refactor:
->AP metadata will be added, the operation of metadata
  will be common except some image entries.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Jun Zhang <jun.zhang@arm.com>
---
